OL,3,AUK threatens to ban Eritreans over
OL,4,Amigrant return policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood has
OL,7,Fthreatened to ban all Eritreans from
OL,8,Fentering the UK if the east African
OL,9,Fcountry's government does not accept
OL,10,Fmore returns of small boat migrants and
OL,11,Fforeign national offenders.
OL,13,FFrom Thursday, Eritrean diplomats will
OL,14,Fface restrictions on their movement
OL,15,Foutside London. Fast-track visas will
OL,16,Falso be stopped for VIPs.
OL,18,FMinisters have previously pressured
OL,19,Fother countries into accepting returns
OL,20,Fby threatening visa bans.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
