OL,3,AHealey says surprise UK growth is 'sign
OL,4,Aof resilience' ahead of Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK economy's stronger than expected
OL,7,Fperformance in August has been called a
OL,8,F"sign of resilience" by Chancellor John
OL,9,FHealey.
OL,11,FHealey told the BBC "it's really tough
OL,12,Fin the face of these economic global
OL,13,Fshocks" as the latest official figures
OL,14,Fshowed the economy grew by 0.1% for the
OL,15,Fmonth, defying analysts' forecasts of a
OL,16,Fslight contraction.
OL,18,FIt follows an upgrade to this year's
OL,19,Fforecast for the UK economy from global
OL,20,Fwatchdog the International Monetary
OL,21,FFund (IMF) earlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
