OL,3,AStudent protesters attack government
OL,4,Abuildings in Albania
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of students have taken to the
OL,7,Fstreets in the Albanian capital of
OL,8,FTirana, attacking several government
OL,9,Fbuildings on the second day of violent
OL,10,Fanti-government protests.
OL,12,FThe demonstration began outside the
OL,13,Fministry of education on Tuesday, as
OL,14,Fstudents called for better university
OL,15,Fconditions and job prospects.
OL,17,FWednesday saw part of the education
OL,18,Fministry's building set on fire, while
OL,19,Fthe prime minister's office, finance
OL,20,Fand interior ministry, and several
OL,21,Fsurrounding businesses were also
OL,22,Fattacked.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
